{{Top}}
The '''Korun''' were a group that inhabited the [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]] [[planet]] of [[Haruun Kal]],<ref name="The Final Order">{{StoryCite|story=The Final Order|book=From a Certain Point of View: The Empire Strikes Back}}</ref> the [[homeworld]] of [[Jedi Master]] [[Mace Windu]].<ref name="Journeys Beginnings">''[[Star Wars Journeys: Beginnings]]''</ref>

Some time after the end of the [[Clone Wars]], the Korun waged an [[Bombardment of Haruun Kal|Insurrection on Haruun Kal]] against the young [[Galactic Empire]]. The insurrectionist Korun attacked from [[tree]]s of Haruun Kal's [[jungle]]s at night, wielding crude [[slugthrower]]s which could not pierce [[stormtrooper armor]] as well as [[bomb]]s which could.<ref name="The Final Order" />

{{Species-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The [[Korun/Legends|Korunnai]] were first introduced in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity in the [[2003]] novel [[Shatterpoint (novel)|''Shatterpoint'']]. The Legends continuity identified the Korunnai as a race of [[Human/Legends|Humans]] to which [[Jedi Master/Legends|Jedi Master]] [[Mace Windu/Legends|Mace Windu]] belonged.

